  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Lava_Rachnid.jpg\" title=\"Lava Rachnid\"><img alt=\"Lava Rachnid\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"207\" src=\"/images/Lava_Rachnid.jpg\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Lava_Rachnid.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Lava Rachnid</div></div></div>\n<p>Miniature versions of <a href=\"/wiki/Widow_Maker\" title=\"Widow Maker\">The Widow Maker</a>, these creatures are spider-like in nature, but have a female torso where the roughly where the spider's thorax should be.  Upon dying, the Lava Rachnids spawn <a href=\"/wiki/Lava_Hatchling\" title=\"Lava Hatchling\">Lava Hatchlings</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n<b>Race:</b> Demi-Human\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Fighter\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lava Rachnid\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ember Rachnid\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">The Embercore Path</a>\n</td></tr></table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
